      "title_at_amendment": "One-wheel landing conditions.",
      "text": "For the one-wheel landing condition, the airplane is assumed to be in the level attitude and to contact the ground on one side of the main landing gear. In this attitude, the ground reactions must be the same as those obtained on that side under Sec. 23.479.",
